<https://id.i2idl.org/definitions/access-to-internet> <http://purl.org/dc/terms/description> "ERIC scope note: The ability or means of individuals to access the Internet through computers, handheld devices, or other electronic devices." <https://id.i2idl.org/graphs/concepts/access-to-internet/versions/1> .
<https://id.i2idl.org/definitions/access-to-internet> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://glossarystudio.app/ns/Definition> <https://id.i2idl.org/graphs/concepts/access-to-internet/versions/1> .
<https://id.i2idl.org/definitions/access-to-internet> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#value> "The availability of means for individuals to connect to and use the Internet through suitable devices and network services." <https://id.i2idl.org/graphs/concepts/access-to-internet/versions/1> .
